                                                                         },
                                                                         {
                                                                             "role":  "user",
                                                                             "content":  "Create a detailed travel video script based on this prompt: {{$json[\u0027Script Prompt\u0027]}}\n\nLocation: {{$json[\u0027Location Focus\u0027]}}\nCurrent weather: {{$(\u0027Get Location Weather Data\u0027).item.json.weather[0].description}}, {{$(\u0027Get Location Weather Data\u0027).item.json.main.temp}}Â°C\nContent type: {{$json[\u0027Content Type\u0027]}}\nTarget platform: {{$json[\u0027Target Platform\u0027]}}\nSurvival element: {{$json[\u0027Survival Element\u0027]}}\n\nInclude practical tips, cultural insights, and safety warnings. Start with a compelling hook about the dangers or unique aspects of this location. Include CTAs for Patreon travel guides and affiliate travel gear."
